msgid ""
"<br/>Each exhibition is a temporary space of reflection,&amp;nbsp;from long-"
"standing collections to new voices, we invite you to enter, pause, and look "
"again"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Vsaka razstava je začasen prostor za razmislek,&amp;nbsp;od dolgoletnih "
"zbirk do novih glasov vas vabimo, da vstopite, se ustavite in pogledate znova"

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em>Melting Silence</em> is a haunting, immersive exhibition by Dutch "
"multimedia artist <strong>Ingrid Baas</strong>, whose work captures the "
"fragile tension between inner stillness and global upheaval. At its core, "
"<em>Melting Silence</em> is an invitation to witness what often goes unheard "
"— the quiet collapse of ecosystems, the slow erosion of memory, and the "
"muted anxiety of a world in flux."
msgstr ""
"<em>Taljenje tišine</em> je pretresljiva, poglobljena razstava nizozemske "
"multimedijske umetnice <strong>Ingrid Baas</strong>, katere delo ujame krhko "
"napetost med notranjo spokojnostjo in globalnimi pretresi. V svojem bistvu "
"je <em>Taljenje tišine</em> povabilo k pričevanju temu, kar pogosto ostane "
"neslišano — tihemu propadanju ekosistemov, počasnemu razkroju spomina in "
"pridušeni tesnobi sveta v nenehnem spreminjanju."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:event.event,description:museum.event_event_4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em>Please note: the museum will close at 5:30 PM on Thursday, July 24.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>Prosimo, upoštevajte: muzej bo v četrtek, 24. julija, zaprt ob 17.30.</"
"em>"

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em>Voices Across Borders</em> is not a celebration. It’s an encounter — "
"with stories often left unheard, with systems that draw lines between lives, "
"and with the artists who refuse to look away."
msgstr ""
"<em>Glasovi onkraj meja</em> niso praznovanje. So srečanje — z zgodbami, ki "
"pogosto ostanejo neslišane, s sistemi, ki zarisujejo meje med življenji, in "
"z umetniki, ki nočejo pogledati stran."

