msgid ""
"<strong>Ingrid Baas</strong> is internationally recognized for her "
"interdisciplinary practice that blends sound art, minimalist sculpture, and "
"sustainable materials. Deeply influenced by northern European landscapes and "
"her early studies in environmental philosophy, Baas creates contemplative "
"environments that draw attention to the unseen — whether emotional, "
"ecological, or societal."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ingrid Baas</strong> je mednarodno priznana po svoji "
"interdisciplinarni praksi, ki združuje zvočno umetnost, minimalistično "
"kiparstvo in trajnostne materiale. Baasova, na katero so močno vplivale "
"severnoevropske krajine in njen zgodnji študij okoljske filozofije, ustvarja "
"kontemplativna okolja, ki usmerjajo pozornost k nevidnemu — naj bo "
"čustvenemu, ekološkemu ali družbenemu."

