#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The exhibition is arranged as a gradual descent into softness, with shifting "
"light, ambient tones, and suspended forms encouraging visitors to slow down, "
"observe, and feel. Each piece echoes the urgency of environmental "
"degradation but resists spectacle. Instead, Baas offers <em>silence as a "
"form of protest</em>, a quiet yet powerful reckoning with the Anthropocene."
msgstr ""
"Razstava je zasnovana kot postopen spust v mehkobo, pri čemer spreminjajoča "
"se svetloba, ambientalni toni in lebdeče oblike obiskovalce spodbujajo, naj "
"se umirijo, opazujejo in občutijo. Vsako delo odseva nujnost degradacije "
"okolja, vendar se upira spektaklu. Namesto tega Baas ponuja <em>tišino kot "
"obliko protesta</em>, tiho, a močno soočenje z antropocenom."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:event.event,description:museum.event_event_4
#, fuzzy
msgid "The museum will be <strong>closed on October 9, 2025</strong>"
msgstr "Muzej bo <strong>zaprt 9. oktobra 2025</strong>"

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This annual event brings together our partners, visitors, and community for "
"a night of critical dialogue through art. It’s a space to question, to "
"listen, and to reflect on the realities of forced movement, cultural "
"erasure, and the search for home."
msgstr ""
"Ta letni dogodek združuje naše partnerje, obiskovalce in skupnost na večeru "
"kritičnega dialoga skozi umetnost. To je prostor za spraševanje, poslušanje "
"in razmišljanje o resničnostih prisilnega razseljevanja, kulturnega izbrisa "
"in iskanja doma."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This event also offers a moment of transparency: what the museum is working "
"on, how we collaborate, and where we’re accountable."
msgstr ""
"Ta dogodek ponuja tudi priložnost za transparentnost: na čem muzej dela, "
"kako sodelujemo in za kaj smo odgovorni."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This exhibition brings together 101 transformative works that changed the "
"course of art history. From iconic paintings to daring contemporary "
"interventions, these pieces challenge, provoke, and redefine what art can "
"be. A celebration of bold vision and enduring influence."
msgstr ""
"Ta razstava združuje 101 prelomno delo, ki je spremenilo tok umetnostne "
"zgodovine. Od ikoničnih slik do drznih sodobnih intervencij ta dela "
"izzivajo, provocirajo in na novo opredeljujejo, kaj je lahko umetnost. "
"Praznovanje drzne vizije in trajnega vpliva."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This suite of applications is designed specifically for institutions in the "
"museum sector; whether you're running a historical museum, a contemporary "
"art gallery, or a science and discovery center. Odoo brings everything you "
"need to\n"
"            manage your operations in one place: from selling tickets and "
"managing memberships, to curating exhibitions, overseeing artwork inventory, "
"operating your shop, and coordinating staff schedules."
msgstr ""
"Ta zbirka aplikacij je zasnovana posebej za ustanove v muzejskem sektorju; "
"ne glede na to, ali vodite zgodovinski muzej, galerijo sodobne umetnosti ali "
"center znanosti in odkrivanja. Odoo vam na enem mestu ponuja vse, kar "
"potrebujete za\n"
"            upravljanje svojega poslovanja: od prodaje vstopnic in "
"upravljanja članstev do priprave razstav, nadzora inventarja umetnin, "
"upravljanja muzejske trgovine in usklajevanja urnikov osebja."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid "This work doesn’t offer closure — it demands witness."
msgstr "To delo ne ponuja razrešitve — zahteva pričo."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.exhibitions
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Through abstract sculpture, sound installations, and light-responsive media, "
"Baas meditates on the sensory and emotional fallout of the <strong>climate "
"crisis</strong>. The title alludes both to the physical reality of melting "
"glaciers and the psychological stillness that follows collective trauma. "
"Silence becomes both a metaphor for neglect and a canvas for resistance — a "
"space where unspoken grief and subtle transformation coexist."
msgstr ""
"S pomočjo abstraktnega kiparstva, zvočnih instalacij in na svetlobo odzivnih "
"medijev Baas premišljuje o čutnih in čustvenih posledicah <strong>podnebne "
"krize</strong>. Naslov namiguje tako na fizično resničnost taljenja "
"ledenikov kot na psihološko mirovanje, ki sledi kolektivni travmi. Tišina "
"postane tako metafora za zanemarjanje kot platno za odpor — prostor, kjer "
"sobivata neizrečena žalost in subtilna preobrazba."

#. module: museum
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:museum.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
